{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03等短时段的感受提示仍然偏密，个别地方也比Y更替人物解释动机，例如S09把想有人陪进一步推成愿意再受气，稍微损失了心理上的暧昧性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更适合边听边扫：关键词加亮让每段叙事的落点很容易抓住，话语与感受交替排列，加上感受按音乐节点出现，不必一次面对一大堆短词。它的音乐变化和身体感受也更有层次，能让人感到人物从离开、怀念、动摇到重新安顿自己的连续变化。Y的优势是人物动机交代得更完整、部分心理表述更克制，但右侧短词容易形成信息堆积，普通观众未必能在相应时间内把它们组织成具体体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0d03934e-9819-4867-bee5-e1cc03335e16", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011914430313Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:20:23.850908+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cb46ad440a0f3936163a39e8e1acfe403f2a8509f0868b9b7712fde258f160a5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha